Data and third-party notices

The MIT license above covers the code in this repository. It does not
claim ownership of the underlying arcade location data.

1. Location data. Arcade location listings are factual information
   published by their respective operators and communities:
   - SEGA ALL.Net location search (location.am-all.net) - SEGA
   - KONAMI e-amusement facility search (p.eagate.573.jp) - KONAMI
   - WAHLAP location service (sega-register.wahlap.net) - WAHLAP
     Technology
   - Zenius-I-Vanisher arcade locations - the Zenius-I-Vanisher community
   - Round1 USA store listings - Round One Entertainment Inc.
   This repository redistributes factual location listings (names,
   addresses, coordinates, available games) with attribution to these
   sources. All trademarks, game titles, and brand names belong to their
   respective owners. If you are a rights holder and want a listing
   corrected or removed, open an issue.

2. Vendored libraries. The following are redistributed under their own
   licenses, with license text retained alongside the vendored files:
   - Leaflet (BSD 2-Clause License, (c) Volodymyr Agafonkin and
     contributors)
   - Leaflet.markercluster (MIT License, (c) Dave Leaver and
     contributors)
   - eviltransform (BSD 2-Clause style license, (c) 2015 Googol Lee and
     contributors)

3. Map tiles. The website loads basemap tiles from OpenStreetMap.
   Map data is (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open
   Database License (ODbL). Tile usage follows the OSM Foundation tile
   usage policy (https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/).
   No tiles are stored in this repository.
